flowchart LR
    Client[Cliente ou operador]
    APIGW[Amazon API Gateway]
    NLB[Network Load Balancer]

    subgraph EKS[Amazon EKS compartilhado]
        OS[OS Service]
        Billing[Billing Service]
        Execution[Execution Service]
        RelayOS[OS Outbox Relay]
        RelayBilling[Billing Outbox Relay]
        RelayExecution[Execution Outbox Relay]
        NR[New Relic agents]
    end

    subgraph SQL[Amazon RDS PostgreSQL compartilhado]
        OSDB[(os_db)]
        BillingDB[(billing_db)]
    end

    Dynamo[(Amazon DynamoDB)]

    subgraph Messaging[Amazon SQS]
        OSQueue[[OS command and event queues]]
        BillingQueue[[Billing command and event queues]]
        ExecutionQueue[[Execution command and event queues]]
        DLQ[[Dead-letter queues]]
    end

    MP[Mercado Pago test environment]
    CPF[AWS Lambda CPF]
    NewRelic[New Relic]

    Client -->|HTTPS REST| APIGW
    APIGW -->|VPC Link| NLB
    NLB -->|route /os| OS
    NLB -->|route /billing| Billing
    NLB -->|route /execution| Execution

    OS -->|SQL; exclusive credentials| OSDB
    Billing -->|SQL; exclusive credentials| BillingDB
    Execution -->|DynamoDB API| Dynamo

    OS -->|transaction| RelayOS
    Billing -->|transaction| RelayBilling
    Execution -->|TransactWriteItems| RelayExecution
    RelayOS --> OSQueue
    RelayBilling --> BillingQueue
    RelayExecution --> ExecutionQueue

    OSQueue --> OS
    BillingQueue --> Billing
    ExecutionQueue --> Execution
    OSQueue -. maxReceiveCount .-> DLQ
    BillingQueue -. maxReceiveCount .-> DLQ
    ExecutionQueue -. maxReceiveCount .-> DLQ

    Billing -->|QR order; status; refund| MP
    MP -->|webhook signal| Billing
    OS -->|synchronous validation| CPF

    OS -. logs and traces .-> NR
    Billing -. logs and traces .-> NR
    Execution -. logs and traces .-> NR
    NR --> NewRelic
